# Planned calendars

## Sales calendar (ops planning — keep separate from Order Workqueue)
- Purpose: future planned plant/ops activities — expected customer ship dates, incoming raw materials, production dates.
- Do **not** merge it into the Order Workqueue unless the user explicitly asks again.
- AR due / AP due do **not** belong on the Sales calendar.

## Finance calendar (built — keep improving)
- Route: `/finance/` (embedded on Finance home) and `/finance/calendar/` (full page via home “Full calendar”; not a separate left-nav item).
- Scope: AR and AP due dates, overdue/today cash tasks, 7-day AR/AP cash outlook.
- Same interaction model as Ops Calendar (month grid, day detail) but **no drag-reschedule** of dues (terms-driven).
- Payment actions link to existing AR/AP payment entry; do not change the invoice create/issue pathway.
